"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&曹操\n文若，官渡地形如何？"]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[20,6,2]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&荀彧\n是。\n&荀彧\n几乎全是山地和树林，\n平地的通路极为狭窄。\n&荀彧\n骑兵恐怕行动不便……\n看来又是许褚将军表现的机会了。"]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[15,3,1]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&许褚\n看我的吧！！"]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[20,5,3]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&荀彧\n哈哈哈哈。"]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[15,0,2]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[20,6,2]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&荀彧\n噢，还有一件重要的事情……\n&曹操\n什么事？\n&荀彧\n主公，我们营寨的东北方，\n有个名叫乌巢的盆地，\n袁绍的粮仓就在该地。\n&曹操\n什么！？粮仓！"]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[20,0,2]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&荀彧\n是的。"]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[20,0,3]},{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":4,"offset":6310,"title":"玩家切换","body_off":6335,"body_end":6580,"conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["玩家切换"]},{"op":45,"name":"test_clicked","args":[22]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&郭嘉\n主公，您认识袁军的许攸吗？\n&郭嘉\n我听说他与主公您是同乡。\n&曹操\n许攸？……想不起来了。\n可能有这么个人吧。\n&郭嘉\n是这样。\n&郭嘉\n听说这个许攸由于器量狭小，\n一直不被袁绍重用，\n因此对此事颇为反感。\n&曹操\n哦？这倒挺有意思的。"]},{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":5,"offset":6580,"title":"玩家切换","body_off":6605,"body_end":7084,"conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["玩家切换"]},{"op":45,"name":"test_clicked","args":[16]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&典韦\n主公，赶快卖了那些木棍吧。"]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&荀攸\n我军虽然得到了很多木棍，\n但也因为救济穷人而损失一些粮草。\n&曹操\n哦。"]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[15]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&曹操\n粮草……"]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&典韦\n對了，這次還有一個神秘的人幫助了\n我和許胖子，我記得他叫許……\n許什麼來著的。"]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[16,0,1]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[15,0,3]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&典韦\n喂，許胖子，許先生他的全名是什麼？\n你還記得嗎？"]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&许褚\n我只記得他跟我一樣姓許，\n然後就什麼也不記得了。"]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&典韦\n欸？"]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&曹操\n許先生……？\n（難道就是许劭先生！？）"]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[16,0,2]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[15,0,2]},{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":6,"offset":7084,"title":"玩家切换","body_off":7109,"body_end":7173,"conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["玩家切换"]},{"op":45,"name":"test_clicked","args":[1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&夏侯惇\n就算拥有大军，\n胜负也并非取决于兵力。"]},{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":7,"offset":7173,"title":"玩家切换","body_off":7198,"body_end":7750,"conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["玩家切换"]},{"op":45,"name":"test_clicked","args":[15]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[0]},{"op":1,"name":"if","args":[],"off":7204,"cond":{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[1824],[]]},"end":15,"end_off":7536},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[15,3]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&许褚\n這次我跟典韋一起討伐黃巾賊，成果豐碩！\n我們不光大顯神威，還收服了一隻老虎喔！"]},{"op":56,"name":"set_attr","args":[0,15,0,254]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[0,17]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&曹操\n真的？那真是太好了。"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[15,0]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[16,16]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&典韦\n然後我和許胖子商量，\n我們決定叫牠胖虎，這名字不錯吧？"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[0,0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&曹操\n哈哈。挺好，挺好……"]},{"op":56,"name":"set_attr","args":[0,15,0,0]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[16,0]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]},{"op":1,"name":"if","args":[],"off":7536,"cond":{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[],[1824]]},"end":18,"end_off":7742},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&许褚\n听说袁军有个非常厉害的武将，\n真想和他单挑看看。\n&曹操\n那员武将叫什么名字？\n&许褚\n我想想，好像跟张辽将军名字很像。\n&张辽\n哦，他叫张郃，许褚将军。\n&许褚\n啊！对对，张郃，是叫张郃！"]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]},{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":8,"offset":7750,"title":"玩家切换","body_off":7775,"body_end":7841,"conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["玩家切换"]},{"op":45,"name":"test_clicked","args":[2]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&张辽\n兵力不是问题，\n好歹要对自己的武力有信心。"]},{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]}]}]}